- Security hardening has almost no surface to bite on here — there is no input boundary, no untrusted data path, no dependency with a risk profile. Do not let a security-focused review manufacture requirements. Testability and edge-case enumeration are the valuable half of speckit's role for this project.
- Do not propose story splits for a one-line boundary fix. Splitting inflates the pipeline for no coverage gain.

